## :sun: Small Joys {.title}

Issue two, autumn

---

## Coffee

The first cup, before anyone else is up.

---

## Bread

Still warm, torn not sliced.

---

## The stoop

A neighbour you haven't seen since June.

---

## Rain

On a day you had nowhere to be.

---

## The library

A book you did not know you wanted.

---

## Evening

The streetlights coming on, one block at a time.

---

## :moon: Until next time

Made on a Sunday, folded on a Monday.
